# Never send secrets, local state or build output into the Docker build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Phase 9: env files at any depth (deploy/.env.production holds the production secrets),
# backup sets and the owner's private photo folder never enter the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
backups
photos
.git
node_modules
.next
media
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
*.log
docs
prompts
# portrait.jpg is NOT ignored: since Phase 3 the pages import it (build-hashed copy for the scene
# and the static composition). Excluding it broke every image build (found in the Phase 9 dry run).
# The encrypted one-time content package is only for the first deployment, never for the image.
deploy/content
